\newlabel{fig:besttaumetrics}{{8}{10}{$\eff $ and $\FR $ at three quantum operating points vs classical. Switching the quantum side from $\tau _{\mathrm {rel}} = 0.35$ (grey dotted) to $\tau ^\star _{F_1}$ strictly improves both metrics at every $T \ge 200$}{figure.8}{}}
